WEBVTT

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:12.570
<b>I tried coming alone to our usual park.</b>

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.070
<b>It's a feeling I've never felt.</b>

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:21.660
<b>Like a child, frightened by the sound of the wind</b>

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:25.670
<b>I ran back along the path home.</b>

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:33.970
<b>The sky outside the window is too vast. Where are you now?</b>

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.130
<b>Please, may this reach you...</b>

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:44.690
<b>Dear Lord, if you ever grant wishes,</b>

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:50.110
<b>grant my wish right now, please!</b>

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:56.240
<b>I want to hear your voice, I miss you! I want to see you now!</b>

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:00.830
<b>Why must you already be looking toward tomorrow?</b>

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:06.210
<b>Don't just brush it off, saying the time has slipped by.</b>

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.540
<b>Once more...</b>

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:14.550
<b>I love you, and yet it's been too late since long ago.</b>

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:19.140
<b>Even if I give up, it can't be like the past.</b>

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:24.350
<b>Don't just decide so simply there's no way, no choice.</b>

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:28.230
<b>Smile once more.</b>

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:34.690
Looks like I win.

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:42.330
Heroman!

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:47.120
The only thing that caused 
me pause is now gone.

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:50.540
All that's left is to devour this planet!

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:01.010
Is this gonna work out all right?

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:03.070
Heroman...

00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:04.550
...lost.

00:02:05.710 --> 00:02:07.050
Heroman!

00:02:07.050 --> 00:02:08.570
Heroman!

00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:10.630
You can't!

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:12.900
This can't be, right, Heroman?

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:27.930
Ooh, that's a nice look in your eyes...

00:02:27.930 --> 00:02:32.480
I'll let you savor all the 
humiliation I faced...

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.180
Now, die.

00:02:34.180 --> 00:02:35.210
Joey!

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:41.200
Worry not.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:48.240
This dinky little planet you tried 
to protect will be finished soon!

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:15.130
<i>Joey!</i>

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.550
<i>Answer me, Joey!</i>

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:17.840
Joey!

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:23.240
What's that?

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:31.770
Joey and Heroman have...

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:36.250
<i>I'm sorry, but we're suspending 
the plan to rescue the President.</i>

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:39.140
<i>Without knowing if Joey 
and Heroman are alive,</i>

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:41.820
<i>it's impossible to tell 
if the plan can proceed.</i>

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:46.300
<i>NIA is now under the command 
of the Vice President.</i>

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:51.170
<i>Also, Kogorr is drilling 
something into the ground.</i>

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:55.460
It seems like he's sucking up an enormous 
amount of energy from the mantel.

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:59.000
It's quite possible that a great 
disaster will befall this planet

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.740
in the next few hours if nothing is done.

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:03.290
What?!

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:07.040
Every country in the world is 
now under a state of emergency,

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:11.220
and at a special meeting of world leaders, 
an emergency measure has been proposed.

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:15.510
In the worst case, if it's agreed upon...

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:18.870
Washington D.C. and the Skrugg base along 
with it will be razed to the ground!

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:25.030
But...

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:30.370
<i>I want you to get as far away from Kogorr, 
or rather Washington D.C., as you can.</i>

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.920
No way!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.920
Hell no!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.920
As if!

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:38.240
Joey ain't that weak!

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:41.560
I didn't give him permission 
to get beat by that guy!

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:42.800
They're fine, I'm sure of it!

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.790
Both Joey and Heroman!

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:45.920
Right?

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:45.920
Right?

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:45.920
Right?

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.550
Of course.

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:53.920
<i>As long as they are still well, 
we will not stop the operation!</i>

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:56.950
Are you insane?!

00:04:56.950 --> 00:05:00.280
If this doesn't work, you guys are done for!

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:02.910
I believe in them, no matter what.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:03.950
So do I.

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:05.280
Of course!

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:07.030
Everyone...

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:10.250
<i>Understood.</i>

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:12.340
<i>I will continue to provide backup.</i>

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:13.300
<i>Over and out.</i>

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:21.740
Now, let's go! To Joey!

00:05:23.910 --> 00:05:25.330
Are you sure?

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:28.430
I have no wish to force you.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:30.820
This is my own personal decision.

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:35.850
I can't trust in him completely yet.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:39.100
But, I believe in you.

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:39.920
Yeah.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:42.790
Thank you.

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:50.870
Pitiful bugs!

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:54.620
This planet's energy will 
all become my sustenance!

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:58.750
I shall once again take to the skies!

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:04.960
You and this planet should all be destroyed!

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:08.130
Did he just say...

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:11.420
<i>The Skrugg have announced 
the end of the world!</i>

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:16.890
<i>What will happen to the White House... 
or rather, to all of humanity?!</i>

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:20.590
The military's arrived, not that it'll help.

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:23.250
We're really gonna get caught up in it now...

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.070
We should get out of here!

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.170
But...

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:27.590
We're almost out of fuel!

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:28.950
Go!

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:41.080
Why didn't you run away?

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:44.220
I wanted to be like my dad.

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:46.600
To be a hero that saved everyone.

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:49.090
But I wasn't able to.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:51.390
Joey!

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:53.670
Joey!

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:55.190
Joey!

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:57.090
Joey!

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:02.700
Finally awake, damn you...

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:04.900
Will!

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:07.930
Did you...

00:07:07.930 --> 00:07:09.650
Don't misunderstand me.

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:13.410
This is because I owed you one.

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:19.410
He came to Earth in order 
to devour the planet itself.

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:25.930
With no one left to stop him, once the meal 
is done he'll break the plate and say so long.

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:31.420
When that saucer is completed, 
this planet is through!

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:34.640
What... did you say?

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:41.580
Annoyingly, you're the only one with any 
chance left to do something in this situation.

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:44.900
B-But Heroman is...

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:48.220
So I'm...

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:50.160
Don't be so weak!

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:54.110
Your dad never gave up, right?

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:05.180
Will!

00:08:09.970 --> 00:08:11.250
<i>Target locked!</i>

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:13.180
<i>Aim for the upper part of the target!</i>

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:25.480
Fools.

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:33.190
That's right!

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:35.700
If you head to the right, even 
the MR-1 can pass through.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.240
You can't go straight, 
there's a giant sinkhole!

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:41.900
If we keep going this way, we'll have no 
choice but to get caught up in the battle.

00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:43.900
If it's ineffective they'll 
call it off quickly.

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:45.570
Just a little further.

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:48.450
<i>Howard, how you located Joey yet?</i>

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:49.640
I apologize.

00:08:49.640 --> 00:08:53.610
I've run every kind of scan, but there's 
so much destruction everywhere...

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:56.750
Not so easy, is it?

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:57.830
<i>No...</i>

00:08:57.830 --> 00:09:02.900
<i>But, even if he is okay, 
there's no longer any way...</i>

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:05.220
<i>There is a way.</i>

00:09:06.510 --> 00:09:07.570
Joey?

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:11.130
Thank goodness...

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:15.350
<i>Mr. Hughes... That ball of 
light that Kogorr is holding...</i>

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:16.530
Yes.

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:19.990
It's sucking up the energy 
from the Earth's nucleus.

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:21.290
As I thought.

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:23.830
<i>The military's attacks are 
just a drop in the bucket.</i>

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:27.190
<i>If it comes to it, I'm being 
told that ballistic missiles</i>

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:30.330
<i>are being aimed at Washington 
D.C. by the world leaders...</i>

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:32.180
<i>That probably won't work.</i>

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:33.720
Yeah...

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:37.340
Our weapons don't work 
against the Skrugg at all.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:39.530
<i>Joey, don't move from there.</i>

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:41.090
<i>I'll come pick you up right away.</i>

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:43.810
No. Please retreat, Mr. Hughes.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.060
What?!

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:48.670
I will destroy that ball of 
light, and Kogorr along with it.

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:50.140
<i>What are you saying?</i>

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:52.400
<i>Heroman is already...</i>

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:54.680
Mr. Hughes...

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:58.250
I've decided I will no 
longer have any doubts.

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:00.410
So...

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:02.780
Joey?

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:04.830
I can feel it.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.010
This is my own power.

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:10.790
If I can blast this power 
inside of that light...

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:12.460
I'll destroy it for sure.

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:14.610
Joey, what are you thinking?

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:15.880
Answer me, Joey!

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:19.830
If it will protect everyone's future,

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:23.700
I'll get it done, no matter what.

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:26.640
Like my dad!

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:27.720
<i>Joey!</i>

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:29.060
<i>Wait, Joey!</i>

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:41.950
What did you say?

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:43.720
<i>I'm sure of it!</i>

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:45.040
<i>Joey is going on a suicide attack!</i>

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.360
That's...

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:47.880
<i>He cut off communications.</i>

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:50.940
<i>You're the closest people to him!</i>

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.960
Please! Stop Joey!

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:57.310
Holly!

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:02.090
Hey, what are you going to do?

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:09.080
You guys catch up!

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:17.820
You're...

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:19.080
We're going together.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.060
Don't blame me if you bite your tongue.

00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:30.460
Holly!

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:34.040
Take it!

00:11:35.850 --> 00:11:38.560
I think you actually got 
a tiny bit cool there!

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:45.110
Joey...

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:51.350
Oh, crap!

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:52.520
Let's get out of here!

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:58.520
Don't!

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:03.320
Why didn't you run away?

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:06.990
I wanted to be like my dad.

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:09.290
To be a hero that saved everyone.

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:13.000
But I wasn't able to back then.

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:15.960
How impudent of you...

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.790
You're still alive?

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:28.010
What?

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.720
So, this time...

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:54.040
So, this time...!

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.510
Joey!

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:12.100
So, this time I'm going to...!

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:24.900
I'm going to...

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:29.760
...protect everyone!

00:13:35.220 --> 00:13:36.450
Farewell.

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:52.010
Heroman?

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:07.320
Heroman!

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:09.320
Why?

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:11.300
You're still alive, too?

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:13.330
Why won't you stay dead?!

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:16.180
It's already nearly too late to stop me!

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:21.720
Just stand there and gaze at the 
moment your world is destroyed!

00:14:32.460 --> 00:14:34.540
Joey!

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:45.650
It can't be...

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:46.520
Joey!

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:49.670
Please, stop this!

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:53.060
You shouldn't have to sacrifice yourself!

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:55.340
Lina, why are you...

00:14:55.870 --> 00:15:01.070
I came here to smack you one 
for trying something so stupid!

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:04.890
Sis... What are you talking about?

00:15:04.890 --> 00:15:08.310
If I don't the entire planet will be 
destroyed and everyone along with it.

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:11.080
Unless I do it...

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:12.510
I have to...

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:15.690
Even if you save everyone by doing that...

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:20.640
Living in a world without you, Joey, 
wouldn't make me happy one bit!

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:25.200
Don't you get it yet?

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:28.450
Our old man worked so hard for our sakes!

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:30.610
It's because we, his family, 
were there for him!

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:32.530
That's why he tried to come home alive!

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:35.280
Thank you.

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:37.830
You're the reason I get up everyday!

00:15:39.990 --> 00:15:44.330
Joey, do you remember the first day we met?

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:49.320
Maybe you've already forgotten.

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:52.050
But, I remember it clearly!

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:55.120
You protected me.

00:15:58.980 --> 00:16:00.180
I remember.

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:03.390
I wasn't able to protect you, Lina.

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:08.110
It was my sister who saved you.

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:12.740
That's not true.

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:15.740
I was so glad...

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:19.490
Back then, all my friends ran away.

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:21.770
They left me behind alone.

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:26.550
When you stayed by my side, Joey...

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:29.020
It made me so happy!

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:34.110
I want to be together with you forever, Joey!

00:16:35.990 --> 00:16:37.010
Lina...

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:39.550
Same for us!

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:47.630
Psy!

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:49.020
Professor Denton!

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:51.190
What's with that face?

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:53.100
We're your partners, right?

00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:57.120
And when the heroes are in trouble, it's 
their partners who should save them, right?

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.490
Hero...es?

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:02.160
That's right.

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:05.120
There's more than one hero.

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.670
You can't be a hero all by yourself.

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:11.730
You've got Heroman, Joey.

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:17.330
And it's because you have Heroman and 
your friends that you can be a hero.

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:23.010
That's exactly why you're heroes!

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:30.230
I see...

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:34.170
So that's how it is...

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:47.290
Now, let's start!

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:55.680
Heroman, I'm sorry.

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:02.330
I was about to leave you all alone.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.650
We're going to be together forever.

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:08.790
So...

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:12.610
We're going to grab our future, together!

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:28.350
<i>Our country is fully prepared!</i>

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:31.820
<i>I'm willing to force it even without 
a decision from the United States!</i>

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:34.380
<i>Just give up on Washington D.C. already!</i>

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:37.440
But, we still don't know the 
status of the President...

00:18:37.440 --> 00:18:40.570
<i>Are you saying the White House is more 
important than the entire planet?</i>

00:18:41.130 --> 00:18:42.580
Vice President!

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:45.970
The Skrugg's bore has entered the nucleus!

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:47.950
So, it's finally come to this...

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:50.160
The President must be...

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:52.590
<i>Please, wait!</i>

00:18:52.590 --> 00:18:53.650
Hughes!

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:56.820
<i>Please postpone the missile launches!</i>

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:58.190
What is it?

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:00.700
<i>Our heroes have appeared.</i>

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:04.250
It is time for me to depart!

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:08.450
It is time for this planet to end!

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:11.160
No, we won't let you end it.

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:12.290
What?

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:27.560
We've always fought together!

00:19:28.090 --> 00:19:32.260
No matter what's happened, we've gotten 
help from everyone to overcome it!

00:19:34.350 --> 00:19:36.910
Damn you!

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:40.000
It's you two, again!

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:44.670
So we won't give up!

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:46.830
No matter what the circumstances!

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:52.540
That's how we've fought our way here!

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.000
Impossible!

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:02.720
Heroman... Go!

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:14.560
A true hero isn't going to make anyone sad.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:17.810
That's what you, and everyone taught me.

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:20.740
I'm not going to choose who to save!

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:26.490
I've got to save ourselves... and everyone!

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:35.580
This time I'll finish you!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:37.580
Joey!

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:38.630
Joey!

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:39.670
Joey!

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:40.750
Joey!

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:44.260
Joey!!!

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:48.550
Heroman...

00:20:49.820 --> 00:20:52.220
O Spark!

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:54.290
Somehow I feel like I understand something.

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:55.510
What?

00:21:55.510 --> 00:21:58.540
The reason why you met Heroman.

00:21:58.800 --> 00:22:02.250
When the Skrugg set their 
eyes on this planet,

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:09.510
the great will of this planet chose you, who 
wanted to be a hero, and gave birth to Heroman.

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:14.170
Which means you were fated to meet!

00:22:14.170 --> 00:22:17.390
Professor, aren't you supposed 
to be some sort of scientist?

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:19.090
He seems like the usual Professor to me!

00:22:29.460 --> 00:22:30.650
Sis.

00:22:32.720 --> 00:22:35.330
You keep this, Sis.

00:22:37.180 --> 00:22:38.640
I want you to have it.

00:23:42.440 --> 00:23:44.820
Excellent work, people.
